# Environment Variables for Project Omnilyth

# Proxy URL for production API calls.
# Default (if unset): https://api.omnilyth.app — the omnilyth-proxy Cloudflare Worker.
# Override only when running against a different worker deployment.
# VITE_PROXY_URL=https://api.omnilyth.app

# Dev-only trade proxy (vite dev server → www.pathofexile.com).
# Put these in .env.local (gitignored), never in a VITE_ variable: they stay in
# the dev server and are never sent to the browser bundle. Used by the
# Mercenary Trade Search "Run search" button for the logged-in complexity limit.
# POESESSID=
# POETOKEN=
